InitializeUnitConcreteTest
├── When the locker is the implementation
│   └── It should revert with {NotLocker}
└── When the locker is not the implementation
    ├── When the locker has already been initialized
    │   └── It should revert with {InvalidInitialization}
    └── When the locker has not been initialized
        ├── It should initialize the locker state
        └── It should set the locker owner
